-- Realism: texts, emails and letters that keep coming after the missions (until now the last text came on day 14 and the
-- last letter on day 13). A row with `every` comes back every that many days (30 or more: the same date every month),
-- until `last_day`: the market's weekly email and paper ad (four of each, in turn), family on Sunday evenings, the
-- team's texts, the fridge cleanout and Patch Tuesday, spam calls and scam texts, the bank statement, credit card
-- offers and other junk mail. Some come once with the season: Halloween candy, the Thanksgiving turkey, a holiday
-- catalog, holiday cards from family, the W-2 and the 1099-INT. The engine adds the weather service's alerts (rain,
-- fog, a freeze) and an email from each company on autopay (bills.company) five days before the bill.
-- The ALTER TABLE lines were run on DoltHub once (2026-10-02); to push this file again, leave them out.
ALTER TABLE messages ADD COLUMN every int;
ALTER TABLE messages ADD COLUMN last_day int;
ALTER TABLE mail ADD COLUMN every int;
ALTER TABLE mail ADD COLUMN last_day int;
ALTER TABLE bills ADD COLUMN company varchar(60);




